{"4351100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solo Build Leveling", "steam_appid": 4351100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an innovative tower defense game. The game will provide a completely different gaming experience from previous tower defense games. Before the game starts, please carefully read the instructions and wish you a pleasant gaming experience. Thank you for your support ❤❤❤❤❤</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower defense mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Defense Mode</strong> <strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional tower defense games, this game adopts bullet guided interaction instead of traditional placement interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In tower defense mode, you will play the role of a hero guarding the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character at the beginning to determine the basic muzzle attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero you play will shoot from left to right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bullet you fired will span two areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are respectively the left token reward area and the right building deployment area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The token reward area on the left can be regarded as a character growth area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a bullet passes through the corresponding token, you can obtain corresponding economy, muzzle attributes, damage, or health based on the color of the token.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy obtained from the token reward area can be used to place the building on the right side, thus completing the closed loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, most of the defense buildings in this game use bullet triggered mode, which produces corresponding skill effects when bullets pass over the heads of defense buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bullets you fired are more like the key to the butterfly effect, making it crucial to use the bullets in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right angle, deploy the defense line reasonably, maximize profits, and regard the fired bullets as the key trump card for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers over 100 muzzle attributes and 100 defense structures for you to choose from, allowing you to combine them to create unique chemical reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivor Mode Introduction</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In survivor mode, you can see yourself as a mobile fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shape of the mobile castle is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More smaller and more flexible it is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More larger and more stronger , but it also means that it is easier to get hurt.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy defensive facilities through constructing systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade by eliminating enemies and gain enhanced attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before facing a powerful enemy, make yourself stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an innovative tower defense game. The game will provide a completely different gaming experience from previous tower defense games. Before the game starts, please carefully read the instructions and wish you a pleasant gaming experience. Thank you for your support ❤❤❤❤❤</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower defense mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Defense Mode</strong> <strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional tower defense games, this game adopts bullet guided interaction instead of traditional placement interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In tower defense mode, you will play the role of a hero guarding the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character at the beginning to determine the basic muzzle attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/e4b2ed1cce3e9437b13bcdaa36a559c9.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero you play will shoot from left to right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/a6f90ed1ddd567b82f393bd36814fd94.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bullet you fired will span two areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are respectively the left token reward area and the right building deployment area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The token reward area on the left can be regarded as a character growth area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a bullet passes through the corresponding token, you can obtain corresponding economy, muzzle attributes, damage, or health based on the color of the token.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy obtained from the token reward area can be used to place the building on the right side, thus completing the closed loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, most of the defense buildings in this game use bullet triggered mode, which produces corresponding skill effects when bullets pass over the heads of defense buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bullets you fired are more like the key to the butterfly effect, making it crucial to use the bullets in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right angle, deploy the defense line reasonably, maximize profits, and regard the fired bullets as the key trump card for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers over 100 muzzle attributes and 100 defense structures for you to choose from, allowing you to combine them to create unique chemical reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/d07c3a772efeb60a9e473514e800df8c.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivor Mode Introduction</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In survivor mode, you can see yourself as a mobile fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shape of the mobile castle is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More smaller and more flexible it is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More larger and more stronger , but it also means that it is easier to get hurt.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6f3eb774a4c658cc79520f3cbe1c4e24.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy defensive facilities through constructing systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/39406b6defee5af1335f5b4b93c4fa99.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade by eliminating enemies and gain enhanced attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/6886de0763b15dfa8c3ae97321474056.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before facing a powerful enemy, make yourself stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.poster.avif?t=1787038056\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.webm?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/extras/8e6d56d5b4d471db3fc392405d6ef648.mp4?t=1787038056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A brand new generation of tactical shooting tower defense game. Try some different！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/13cfb273cf862550a70f52f59dd74de98e187d7f/header.jpg?t=1787038056", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/2f206e99db75988441103c25d349cbf076cbee78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787038056", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/2f206e99db75988441103c25d349cbf076cbee78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787038056", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Flute Games"], "publishers": ["Flute Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/ac3aeef79bc016d163a719f70fa2dd1ca8fa0a32/ss_ac3aeef79bc016d163a719f70fa2dd1ca8fa0a32.600x338.jpg?t=1787038056", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351100/ac3aeef79bc016d163a719f70fa2dd1ca8fa0a32/ss_ac3aeef79bc016d163a719f70fa2dd1ca8fa0a32.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787038056"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass